# Live prod check — mdeai.co

> **When:** class **S**, user says "check prod", or persona-visible ship claim. Tier 1 curl+smoke often enough; full matrix for chat/agents PRs.

**URL:** https://www.mdeai.co/ · **Companion:** [`tasks/testing/09-prod-live-journey-matrix.md`](../../../tasks/testing/09-prod-live-journey-matrix.md)

Agents **must not** claim ship/Done on persona-visible changes without prod proof. Pair with [`mdeai-testing.mdc`](./mdeai-testing.mdc) (localhost + evidence paths).

## When to run

| Trigger | Depth |
|---------|--------|
| Any PR touching chat, agents, maps, cards, API routes | **Full matrix** (below) |
| Daily / before merge to `main` | **Quick** (Tier 1) |
| After Vercel deploy | **Quick** + one Browser prompt |
| User says "check prod" / `@Browser` | Full matrix on prod |

## Tier 1 — Quick (≤2 min, no browser)

```bash
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "prod GET / -> %{http_code}\n" https://www.mdeai.co/
node /home/sk/mdeai/tasks/testing/scripts/chat-smoke.mjs --base https://www.mdeai.co
```

**Pass:** GET `/` → 200 · rentals/events API shape OK · `/api/copilotkit` empty body → 400 (not 5xx).

## Tier 2 — Browser MCP (interactive, prod)

1. `browser_navigate` → `https://www.mdeai.co/` · viewport **≥1360px**
2. Hide dev inspector if present: `#cpk-web-inspector { display: none !important; }`
3. Send prompts (React textarea — `input` event + Send; empty textarea keeps Send disabled):

| Vertical | Sample prompt | Assert |
|----------|---------------|--------|
| **Events** | `salsa events this weekend in Medellín` | `[data-testid="event-card"]` ≥1 |
| **Restaurants** | `quiet rooftop dinner in Provenza` | `[data-testid="restaurant-card"]` ≥1 |
| **Cafés** | `quiet specialty coffee in Laureles` | `[data-testid="grounded-card"][data-result-kind="cafe"]` ≥1 |
| **Rentals** | `1BR in Laureles under $80/night` | `[data-testid="rental-card"]` ≥1 |

4. Map: pins appear in `[data-testid="map-panel"]` after cards (not stuck on "No pins yet")
5. Screenshot → `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/prod-<vertical>.png`

## Tier 3 — Playwright prod synthetic (SAN-462)

```bash
cd /home/sk/mdeai/mdeapp
PROD_SMOKE_BASE_URL=https://www.mdeai.co \
PROD_SMOKE_OUT_DIR=../tasks/testing/evidence/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)/prod-synthetic \
npx playwright test e2e/prod-synthetic-smoke.spec.ts --project=chromium --workers=1

PROD_SMOKE_OUT_DIR=../tasks/testing/evidence/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)/prod-venues \
npm run test:e2e:prod-venues-journey
```

Runs core 4 verticals + CK POST budget + **J05–J08** venues journeys. Per-task: `npm run verify:task -- <TASK-ID>`. See [`improve.md`](../../../tasks/notes/improve.md).

## Tier 4 — Chrome DevTools MCP (debug only)

Use when Browser/Playwright fails:

- `list_network_requests` — no 401/403/500 on `/api/copilotkit`, `/api/rentals/search`, `/api/events/search`
- `list_console_messages` — no uncaught errors on load
- `take_snapshot` — a11y tree matches expected regions (`Concierge chat`, `Search results on map`)

## Fail actions

| Symptom | Likely cause | Check |
|---------|--------------|-------|
| Cards but no pins | MAP-008B / mapId | env on Vercel |
| Wrong card kind (café for clubs) | VEN-012 routing | nightlife query |
| CK POST storm | CopilotKit loop | count POSTs per query (<8) |
| 502 on places detail | DATA-008 cache cold | `/api/places/detail` |

## Evidence

Write `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/prod-live-RESULTS.md`:

```markdown
| Check | localhost | prod |
|-------|-----------|------|
| chat-smoke | PASS | PASS |
| events prompt | … | … |
| restaurants | … | … |
| cafés | … | … |
```

## Do not skip prod because

Localhost-only proof misses Vercel env (Map ID, ADK URL, auth cookies, edge cold start).
